		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://nairametrics.com/?p=550289</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>Bamboo, one of the platforms handling subscriptions for the Dangote Refinery IPO, experienced downtime within the first 30 minutes of the offer opening after traffic surged beyond 10 times its normal level.</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://nairametrics.com/2026/09/24/why-bamboo-app-went-down-during-dangote-refinery-ipo-ceo/">Why Bamboo app went down during Dangote Refinery IPO &#8211; CEO</a> appeared first on <a href="https://nairametrics.com">Nairametrics</a>.</p>
]]></description>
		
